#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:4
msgid "2022-06-07"
msgstr "2022-06-07"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:7
msgid ""
"The project maintainer was notified about this report and instructed to "
"submit a counter if they believed this request was invalid. The user removed"
" the project manually, and no further action was required."
msgstr "项目维护者已收到此报告的通知，并被指示若认为该请求无效可提交反通知。用户已手动移除该项目，无需进一步处理。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:11
msgid ""
"Are you the copyright owner or authorized to act on the copyright owner's "
"behalf?"
msgstr "你是版权所有者，还是获授权代表版权所有者行事？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:12
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:36
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "是"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:14
msgid "What work was allegedly infringed? If possible, please provide a URL:"
msgstr "涉嫌侵权的作品是什么？如可能，请提供 URL："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:15
msgid "https://www.dicomstandard.org/current"
msgstr "https://www.dicomstandard.org/current"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:17
msgid ""
"What files or project should be taken down? You should list URLs to each "
"piece of infringing content. If you allege that the entire project is "
"infringing on copyrights you hold, please specify the entire project as "
"infringing:"
msgstr "应下架哪些文件或项目？你应列出每一处侵权内容的 URL。若你主张整个项目侵犯你持有的版权，请将整个项目指定为侵权："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:18
msgid "https://dicom-standard.readthedocs.io/en/latest/index.html"
msgstr "https://dicom-standard.readthedocs.io/en/latest/index.html"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:20
msgid "Is the work licensed under an open source license?"
msgstr "该作品是否以开源许可证授权？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:21
msgid "No"
msgstr "否"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:23
msgid "What would be the best solution for the alleged infringement?"
msgstr "对所涉嫌侵权，什么是最佳解决方案？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:24
msgid "Complete Removal."
msgstr "完全移除。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:26
msgid ""
"Do you have the alleged infringer's contact information? Yes. If so, please "
"provide it:"
msgstr "你是否有被指控侵权方的联系信息？是的话，请提供："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:27
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:39
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:42
msgid "[private]"
msgstr "[private]"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:29
msgid ""
"Type (or copy and paste) the following statement: \"I have a good faith "
"belief that use of the copyrighted materials described above on the "
"infringing web pages is not authorized by the copyright owner, or its agent,"
" or the law. I have taken fair use into consideration.\""
msgstr "输入（或复制粘贴）以下声明：\"我善意相信，上述侵权网页中对所述受版权保护材料的使用，未经版权所有者或其代理人或法律授权。我已考虑合理使用。\""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:30
msgid ""
"I have a good faith belief that use of the copyrighted materials described "
"above on the infringing web pages is not authorized by the copyright owner, "
"or its agent, or the law. I have taken fair use into consideration."
msgstr "我善意相信，上述侵权网页中对所述受版权保护材料的使用，未经版权所有者或其代理人或法律授权。我已考虑合理使用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:32
msgid ""
"Type (or copy and paste) the following statement: \"I swear, under penalty "
"of perjury, that the information in this notification is accurate and that I"
" am the copyright owner, or am authorized to act on behalf of the owner, of "
"an exclusive right that is allegedly infringed.\""
msgstr "输入（或复制粘贴）以下声明：\"我宣誓，在伪证处罚之下，本通知中的信息准确无误，且我是版权所有者，或获授权代表其所有者行事，主张一项涉嫌被侵犯的专有权。\""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:33
msgid ""
"I swear, under penalty of perjury, that the information in this notification"
" is accurate and that I am the copyright owner, or am authorized to act on "
"behalf of the owner, of an exclusive right that is allegedly infringed."
msgstr "我宣誓，在伪证处罚之下，本通知中的信息准确无误，且我是版权所有者，或获授权代表其所有者行事，主张一项涉嫌被侵犯的专有权。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:35
msgid ""
"Please confirm that you have read our Takedown Policy: "
"https://docs.readthedocs.io/en/latest/dmca/index.html"
msgstr "请确认你已阅读我们的下架政策：https://docs.readthedocs.io/en/latest/dmca/index.html"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:38
msgid ""
"So that we can get back to you, please provide either your telephone number "
"or physical address:"
msgstr "为便于我们回复你，请提供你的电话号码或实际地址："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/dmca/archive/2022-06-07.rst:41
msgid "Please type your full legal name below to sign this request:"
msgstr "请在下方输入你的法定全名以签署本请求："

